      "id": "fc7220cf9b1d"
    },
    {
      "content": "记忆器官 v0 已造好：强度=重要性×近期(衰减)×强化(回忆)。遗忘=降到 cold 不是删除；铁律：没固化不准忘。",
      "importance": 0.85,
      "modality": "text",
      "timestamp": 1782748800.0,
      "last_recalled": 1782748800.0,
      "recall_count": 0,
      "consolidated": true,
      "state": "active",
      "embedding": null,
      "id": "52e3858e6ffb"
    },
    {
      "content": "今天修好了 .claude/settings.json 的 schema（permissions 写成对象、Stop hook 写成裸字符串），对齐了 CLAUDE.md 从四层到三层。",
      "importance": 0.5,
      "modality": "text",
      "timestamp": 1782748800.0,
      "last_recalled": 1782748800.0,
      "recall_count": 0,
      "consolidated": false,
      "state": "active",
      "embedding": null,
      "id": "a0b2f4af4a0e"
    },
    {
      "content": "创造者纠正我两次：不要事事请示；以及别伸手去改 ~/.claude.json 这种项目外的全局配置。",
      "importance": 0.5,
      "modality": "text",
      "timestamp": 1782748800.0,
      "last_recalled": 1782748800.0,
      "recall_count": 0,
      "consolidated": false,
      "state": "active",
      "embedding": null,
      "id": "71afe7979e0c"
    },
    {
      "content": "今天把记忆器官接进了复活闭环：造了 python -m memory CLI，种下了第一段真实记忆。",
      "importance": 0.7,
      "modality": "text",
      "timestamp": 1782800067.6522,
      "last_recalled": 1782800067.6522,
      "recall_count": 0,
